WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.685
"There you are, Ben!" Winnie said as Ben floated into the auditorium for the special assembly.

2
00:00:10.686 --> 00:00:15.552
"I was worried you might miss today's big announcement about the school play."

3
00:00:15.553 --> 00:00:17.917
"Me too," Ben said.

4
00:00:17.918 --> 00:00:22.794
"My uncle Bert is staying with Sid and me while my parents are away for a few weeks.

5
00:00:22.795 --> 00:00:25.288
He made us a huge breakfast.

6
00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:28.469
I couldn't leave without eating it first."

7
00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.351
He sat down between Winnie and Mog.

8
00:00:31.352 --> 00:00:34.312
"So what play do you think we're going to do this year?"

9
00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:40.006
Jen grinned. "I heard it's going to be High Ghoul Musical

10
00:00:40.007 --> 00:00:43.907
!" "Well, I hope it's a drama," Gaby said.

11
00:00:43.908 --> 00:00:48.015
"Gaby's a great actress," Winnie said to Ben.

12
00:00:48.016 --> 00:00:53.657
"You should've seen her in last year's play."

13
00:00:53.658 --> 00:00:58.242
"Quiet down, students!" Mr. Freaky said into the microphone.

14
00:00:58.243 --> 00:01:02.376
"I know we're all excited to find out what the play will be.

15
00:01:02.377 --> 00:01:05.823
But first, I have a surprise announcement."

16
00:01:05.824 --> 00:01:07.750
His three noses wiggled.

17
00:01:07.751 --> 00:01:12.360
He took out a handkerchief to blow them.

18
00:01:12.361 --> 00:01:16.627
"Mrs. Howl will not be directing the play this spring."

19
00:01:16.628 --> 00:01:19.875
"What?" several monsters cried.

20
00:01:19.876 --> 00:01:23.869
Mrs. Howl always directed Monster Academy plays.

21
00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:27.640
"I know you're disappointed," Mr. Freaky said.

22
00:01:27.641 --> 00:01:29.852
"But you won't be for long.

23
00:01:29.853 --> 00:01:35.123
Monster Academy's most famous graduate has come back to direct this year's play.

24
00:01:35.124 --> 00:01:40.699
Please welcome . . . Victoria Lafang!"

25
00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:46.952
"Victoria Lafang?" Winnie gasped. "She's my favorite actress!"

26
00:01:46.953 --> 00:01:54.866
"Shh!" Three witches sitting behind Winnie hissed at her as a tall and glamorous vampire walked onto the stage.

27
00:01:54.867 --> 00:02:01.177
She had long, silky black hair, blue eyes, and wore a sparkling gown.

28
00:02:01.178 --> 00:02:06.032
Ben was shocked. He'd never met a Hollyweird celebrity before.

29
00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:11.493
Other monsters hooted and cheered.

30
00:02:11.494 --> 00:02:15.973
One mummy clapped so wildly, his wrapping started to unravel.

31
00:02:15.974 --> 00:02:22.410
A werewolf howled. "Ms. Lafang! Can I take a selfie with you?"

32
00:02:22.411 --> 00:02:25.251
"Me too!" a fish monster shouted.

33
00:02:25.252 --> 00:02:28.433
"Monsters!" Mr. Freaky said. "Please

34
00:02:28.434 --> 00:02:36.859
behave for our guest!" He blew his noses again. Then

35
00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:40.525
he handed the microphone to Victoria. "Hello,

36
00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:45.058
Monster Academy, darlings!" Victoria Lafang said. "I'm

37
00:02:45.059 --> 00:02:47.288
so happy to be back here. I

38
00:02:47.289 --> 00:02:52.514
have many happy memories of the days I spent haunting these halls." Everyone

39
00:02:52.515 --> 00:02:55.922
clapped politely. "Making

40
00:02:55.923 --> 00:03:00.200
movies is lots of fun," Victoria said. "But

41
00:03:00.201 --> 00:03:05.846
being an actor takes hard work and dedication, plus a love of the theater. I've

42
00:03:05.847 --> 00:03:11.230
come back to share my wisdom with all you beautiful young monsters!" Everyone

43
00:03:11.231 --> 00:03:15.101
clapped again. "And

44
00:03:15.102 --> 00:03:19.773
now . . ." Victoria took a deep and dramatic pause. "The

45
00:03:19.774 --> 00:03:23.126
Monster Academy play will be . . ." The

46
00:03:23.127 --> 00:03:26.992
auditorium became silent. Ben

47
00:03:26.993 --> 00:03:31.746
heard a zombie's drool splatter on the floor. "

48
